{"kind":"doc","route":"/guide/routing/pending-ui","title":"Non-blocking navigation","blocks":[{"t":"heading","level":1,"id":"non-blocking-navigation","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Non-blocking navigation"}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"By default, a slow guard or resolver can leave the current screen unchanged with"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"no feedback. "},{"t":"code","text":"CraftRouterOutlet()"},{"t":"text","text":" commits the URL immediately and shows a"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"pending component only if the wait is actually noticeable."}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":""},{"t":"strong","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Use it when"}]},{"t":"text","text":" guards or resolvers do real work — an HTTP call, a permission"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"check."},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"For synchronous routes, the outlet renders the target immediately."}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"code","text":"CraftRouterOutlet()"},{"t":"text","text":" provides "},{"t":"strong","children":[{"t":"text","text":"non-blocking"}]},{"t":"text","text":" navigation:"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"the URL commits immediately, a pending component appears only if the guard/resolve chain is slow,"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"and the target component is mounted "},{"t":"strong","children":[{"t":"text","text":"only on success"}]},{"t":"text","text":" — never while an exception is being"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"resolved."}]},{"t":"heading","level":2,"id":"setup","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Setup"}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Call the outlet inside a Craft component tree:"}]},{"t":"code","lines":[{"tokens":[{"text":"import","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" { CraftRouterOutlet, craftComponent, main } ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"from","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"'@craft-ts/component'","kin